{"id":"msg_m_mainafter_09_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_counters","label":"Counters · Group"},"label":"8. I didn't expect you to say that at that time.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_mainafter_07_01","next":"msg_m_mainafter_14_01","speakers":{"anis":"Anis","rapi":"Rapi","neon":"Neon"},"icons":{"anis":"si_c012_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_1","text":"I didn't expect you to say that at that time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_2","text":"Wasn't it too early to say?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_3","text":"Nope.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_4","text":"They would find out soon even if I didn't say anything.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_5","text":"As long as someone sensed the unusuality and watched carefully,\nmy trick would be discovered immediately.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_6","text":"I thought you would never let anything slip, Rapi.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_7","text":"Me, too.\nBut things are not like this for the observer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_8","text":"Even though I paid much attention, my unconscious habits would still betray me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_9","text":"But it paid off for us to say it before we got caught.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_10","text":"Good timing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_11","text":"But still, you should have let Commander know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_12","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_12","text":"Then I would have definitely stopped her.","jump":"m_mainafter_09_02_14"},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_13","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_13","text":"You let me down.","jump":"m_mainafter_09_02_17"},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_14","text":"Master might think that's selling out Rapi.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_15","text":"Can't deny that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_16","text":"Sorry for freaking you out.","jump":"m_mainafter_09_02_21"},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_17","text":"Sorry.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_18","text":"But Commander, you would definitely stop me, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_19","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_20","text":"Well, can't deny that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_21","text":"Still, you have my gratitude.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_22","text":"It is I that should thank you for your concern.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_23","text":"Whoa, I'm starting to feel a bit embarrassed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_24","text":"Then, let's flood the screen!","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_25","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_26","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_27","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_28","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_29","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_30","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_31","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_32","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_33","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_34","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_35","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_09_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_09_02_36","text":"... I think that's enough.","jump":null}],"chat":true}